# Files excluded from the submission tarball in FOLDER mode (`whest package --estimator .`).
# Single-file mode (`whest package --estimator estimator.py`) ignores this file entirely —
# it ships exactly one file, renamed to estimator.py.
# whest reads BOTH .gitignore and .whestignore as one pattern list, and there is no `!`
# negation: a pattern in .gitignore that matches a data file you mean to ship (weights.npz,
# a lookup table) drops it silently. Always read the file list in the package preview.
# Everything below is local-only tooling/docs; without it this repo packages 64 files and
# trips the 50-file cap.

# Version control / CI / envs
.git/
.github/
.venv/
.python-version

# Caches & build artifacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/

# Local-iteration helpers — used by `python estimator.py`, NOT by the grader
local_engine.py
examples/
tests/

# Docs, assets, and project scaffolding
docs/
assets/
scripts/
Makefile
README.md
pyproject.toml
uv.lock
